[2026-03-16T03:47:24.496Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011cVbgf5LhuXwcGA98ozpE6","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Resolve Merge Conflicts\n     2→\n     3→After an automatic merge resolved conflicts using `--theirs` (accepting the remote version),\n     4→the codebase may have lost local changes. Your job is to review and fix any issues.\n     5→\n     6→## Steps\n     7→\n     8→1. Search the entire repo for conflict markers (`<<<<<<<`, `=======`, `>>>>>>>`) and resolve\n     9→   any that remain.\n    10→2. Review recent git history (`git log --oneline -10` and `git diff HEAD~2`) to understand\n    11→   what local changes may have been overwritten by the auto-resolution.\n    12→3. Re-apply any lost local changes that are still relevant, using your judgment.\n    13→4. Run `npm run check` in each affected app directory to verify the codebase is healthy.\n    14→5. Fix any typecheck or lint errors introduced by the merge.\n    15→\n    16→When all conflicts are resolved and checks pass, output `<DONE>`.\n    17→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5a575e0f-1962-4cf4-866c-a7442860fdfa","uuid":"97b5fb73-11b9-47cb-8027-fe26281ac7ac","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/skills/tasks/resolveConflicts.md","content":"# Resolve Merge Conflicts\n\nAfter an automatic merge resolved conflicts using `--theirs` (accepting the remote version),\nthe codebase may have lost local changes. Your job is to review and fix any issues.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Search the entire repo for conflict markers (`<<<<<<<`, `=======`, `>>>>>>>`) and resolve\n   any that remain.\n2. Review recent git history (`git log --oneline -10` and `git diff HEAD~2`) to understand\n   what local changes may have been overwritten by the auto-resolution.\n3. Re-apply any lost local changes that are still relevant, using your judgment.\n4. Run `npm run check` in each affected app directory to verify the codebase is healthy.\n5. Fix any typecheck or lint errors introduced by the merge.\n\nWhen all conflicts are resolved and checks pass, output `<DONE>`.\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}}}
